{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very simple but exciting game that you can play while talking on the phone with a friend or at a meeting, helps you concentrate. And also a very powerful tool for developing memory and attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does not depend on donations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No dropped items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No achievements to complete! (only one when starting and closing the game for the first time)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is done so that the player immerses himself and is imbued with the idea of \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200bthis game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play, get credits and as they accumulate, open a new level, for each new level a unique animated theme is given - a background!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3250310/408ab59ebfc997ba47454cf6278dff08b41cb0ec.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3250310?t=1760474077","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250310/e05063b4db4516509323abaf9ea5fb90d0ab6e56/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760474077","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250310/ca8deebfb754b3dc40c879df6fbf939404894bd1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760474077","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250310/ca8deebfb754b3dc40c879df6fbf939404894bd1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760474077","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description